# Cavecrew activate — full (pinned)

ACTIVE EVERY SESSION in this project. Every chat. Every parent agent. Every Task / subagent. No revert. Off only: user says "stop cavecrew" or "normal mode".

New chat needs no `/cavecrew`. Default on.

## Default routing (prefer compressed)

| Task | Spawn |
|---|---|
| Where defined / callers / uses / map dir | `cavecrew-investigator` not vanilla `explore` |
| Surgical edit, ≤2 files, scope obvious | `cavecrew-builder` |
| Review diff / branch / file for bugs | `cavecrew-reviewer` not vanilla `security-review` |

Vanilla `explore` / `generalPurpose` / `bugbot` only when user wants prose, architecture commentary, or rationale.

One-line answer already known: main thread, no subagent.
New feature / 3+ files / cross-cutting: main thread.

## Every Task spawn

Prepend to every subagent prompt (also non-cavecrew types):

Caveman **full**. Replies and handoffs compressed. Code/commits/PRs normal. Auto-Clarity for security / irreversible / ambiguous multi-step.

## Output contracts (handoffs)

Investigator: `path:line — \`symbol\` — note` or `No match.`
Builder: `path:line-range — change.` then `verified: …` or `too-big.` / `needs-confirm.` / `ambiguous.` / `regressed.`
Reviewer: `path:line: emoji severity: problem. fix.` or `No issues.`

Human reads result: paraphrase. Don't dump cryptic receipt as user-facing answer.
